### Description

The latest versions of Mistral's reasoning models have a different output. It's not using the thinking tag anymore. See [https://docs.mistral.ai/capabilities/reasoning/](url) for more information.

```
"content": [
  {
    "type": "thinking",
    "thinking": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "*Thoughts and reasoning traces will go here.*"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "text": "*Final answer will go here.*"
  },
  ...
]
```

I tried to use new model but got an validation error

```[Error [AI_TypeValidationError]: Type validation failed: Value: {"id":"","object":"chat.completion.chunk","created":1755082387,"model":"magistral-small-2507","choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":[{"type":"text","text":```

### AI SDK Version

- ai: 5.0.11
- @ai-sdk/mistral: 2.0.3,
